{
  "_readme": "Production tokens for the approved Banking Clarity direction. Opaque colours use #RRGGBB; scrims and shadow colours use #RRGGBBAA. Brand hero in either theme: a 118deg sRGB gradient from color.stage.light.steadying to color.stage.light.thriving, with color.light.onAccent for all text and the filled arc; use color.stage.light.building for its empty ring track. This gradient is branding, not a financial-state signal. Elsewhere use the current theme. Header wash uses accentSoft fading to bg. line and gridline are decorative only; use neutral or chart.predicted for essential boundaries. Category and stage colours are graphic fills, not body-text colours. Caution and below-zero states stay blue-grey. positive is for confirmed completion, never increased spending. destructive is only for delete/disconnect controls. Tab-bar height excludes device safe-area inset. Respect reduced-motion preferences; remove nonessential animation.",
